<%- include("../../partials/breadcrumb-nav") %>

<section class="layout-container" id="chairman">
    <!--Director's Message Heading-->
    <div class="generic-heading__row">
        <div class="generic-heading__title-group">
            <div class="red-vertical__accent"></div>
            <h3>Message from the Chairman</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="__divider">
            <div class="__line"></div>
            <div class="__dot"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <img src="/images/Chairman Msg.webp" alt="Chairman Msg"
        style="height: 400px; width: auto; margin-inline: auto; margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">

    <!-- Director Message -->
    <h5 style="margin-top:0.5rem; text-align: center;">
        Welcome back to a promising Academic Year! Exciting
        Opportunities await you.
    </h5>

    <span>Dear Students,</span>

    <p>
        It gives me immense pleasure to welcome you to Bright School & College of Nursing. Our institution is
        built on the vision of creating skilled, compassionate, and dedicated healthcare professionals who can
        serve society with commitment and integrity. In today’s fast-growing healthcare sector, the need for qualified
        nurses is increasing globally. At
        Bright, we are committed to providing quality education, strong clinical exposure, and values that shape
        both professional excellence and personal growth.
    </p>

    <p>
        Choosing Nursing specially BSc Nursing as your profession is not just a career choice—it’s a
        calling. It requires empathy, patience, and dedication. A beautiful journey filled with compassion,
        purpose, and the deep sense of making a difference in the world. It will give you a sense of
        fulfillment, a sense of pride, and a sense of purpose that you can carry with you every day of your
        life. While your journey may include challenges, remember that perseverance and hard work will guide you
        toward success. Stay focused, continue learning, and believe in your abilities. Our institution is
        here to support and guide you at every step.
    </p>

    <p>
        We focus not only on academic success but also on character building, discipline, and service to
        humanity. I invite students to join us and become part of a noble profession that truly makes a
        difference in people’s lives. Seek support when needed, and always believe in your ability to overcome
        obstacles. Your success is not
        just a personal achievement but a testament to the strength of our academic community. Let us uphold the
        values of integrity, compassion, and professionalism that define our institution.
    </p>

    <span>
        <strong>
            Wishing you a journey filled with success, personal growth, and the fulfillment of your dreams.
        </strong>
    </span>

</section>

<section class="layout-container" id="vice-chairman">
    <!--Director's Message Heading-->
    <div class="generic-heading__row">
        <div class="generic-heading__title-group">
            <div class="red-vertical__accent"></div>
            <h3>Message from the Vice-Chairman</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="__divider">
            <div class="__line"></div>
            <div class="__dot"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Vice Chairman Message -->

    <img src="/images/Vice Chairman Msg.webp" alt="Vice Chairman Msg"
        style="height: 400px; width: auto; margin-inline: auto; margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">

    <h5 style="margin-top:0.5rem; text-align: center;">
        Warm Greetings and Best Wishes!
    </h5>

    <span>Dear Students,</span>
    <br>
    <p>
        I warmly welcome you to Bright School & College of Nursing. It is a matter of great pride to see young,
        passionate individuals choosing a profession that is dedicated to care, compassion, and service to
        humanity. At Bright, we believe that education is not only about gaining knowledge but also about building
        character, discipline, and a sense of responsibility. Nursing is a profession that demands kindness,
        patience, and emotional strength. You will have the opportunity to touch lives, bring comfort to those
        in need, and make a real difference in society.
    </p>

    <p>
        We are committed to creating a supportive and encouraging environment where every student can grow
        academically and personally. Our aim is to help you become confident, skilled, and compassionate
        professionals who uphold the highest standards of healthcare. Always stay positive, work hard, and never stop
        learning. Believe in yourself and your ability to
        overcome challenges. Your dedication and sincerity will lead you to success.
    </p>

    <p>
        Celebrate every milestone, no matter how small, and use setbacks as valuable lessons. Surround yourself
        with positivity, seek guidance when needed, and remember that your journey is uniquely yours. You have
        the potential to achieve great things, and I believe in your ability to make a positive impact on the
        world.
    </p>

    <span>
        <strong>
            I wish you a wonderful academic journey filled with learning, growth, and achievement.
        </strong>
    </span>
</section>